### Criação de usuários = CREATE

POST http://localhost:3000/users HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "João da Silva", 
    "email": "joao@gmail.com", 
    "password": "123@123W", 
    "phone": "(16)99999-9999", 
    "CPF": "666.278.307-28"
}

### Leitura de todos os usuários = READ

GET http://localhost:3000/users HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json 

### Leitura de informações especificas(nome & email) - Aqui em users estamos usando apenas where = READ

GET http://localhost:3000/users?name=kleber&email=kriano@gmail.com HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

### Procura por id = READ

GET http://localhost:3000/users/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json


### Delete = Delete
DELETE http://localhost:3000/users/3 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### PUT - Atualização de informações
PUT http://localhost:3000/users/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "name": "Kleber",
    "email": "kleber@gmail.com",
    "phone": "(16)32135-2341"
}

